- Add intra-Ark Lightning fees to the fee schedule
  `FeeSchedule::intra_ark` holds the Lightning send and receive fees of a
  payment between two wallets of the same Ark server, which the server
  settles without Lightning. When it is absent, such a payment pays the
  normal Lightning fees.
  [#21](https://github.com/SatoshiPortal/scuttle/pull/21)
